  "source_ref": "KRC3701-CARRIER Data sheet rev 1.2 (PL BANK X1_1/X1_2 Signal Tables, MGT Signal Table) joined with KRM-3Z7030-045 Data sheet rev 1.9 Pin Mapping (module pin -> FPGA ball); balls are the mated KRM-3Z7045 SoM's XC7Z045 FFG676 (FBG/FFG 676 shared footprint; GTX bank 111 lanes DP4-DP7/DP0-DP3 split across banks 111/112, bank 111 only bonded on KRM-3Z7035/45 modules). Corrections: carrier MGT table cell FMC_D21 read as FMC_B21 (GBTCLK1_M2C_N; ball R5 = MGTREFCLK0N_112 pairs R6 at B20; D21 already carries LA17_CC_N). Vendor 'GBTCLKC_0/1' index naming is swapped vs VITA positions - connector position decides. Vendor net CLK0_C2M_P/N at G2/G3 recorded as CLK1_M2C_P/N (position); vendor drives it host->card. FMC SCL/SDA reach module bank pins X2_1_306/307 via level shifter but no doc maps those to X2 pins - excluded. PRSNT_M2C_L/PG_C2M/GA/JTAG route to the BMC/power manager, not the FPGA - excluded. Not schematic-verified (no schematic published).",
